@startuml DCD-03
title DCD-03 - Diagrama de clases de diseño: motor de recomendaciones

' Paquete service.recommendation: un servicio por tipo de item y un servicio combinador
' (ItemRecommendationService). Cada subservicio resuelve la lista o el usuario con
' EntityResolver y calcula los atributos dominantes con los rankings de dominio de ItemList
' / User (getTop...From..., getMain...From...), que usan Utils.getTopNMostRepeated.
' Las recomendaciones de Spotify están en DCD-04.
' Reglas: architecture.md §8 y recommendations.md.
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor<<RestController>> #E3F0FF
    BorderColor<<RestController>> #3D6FA8
    BackgroundColor<<Service>> #E6F5E6
    BorderColor<<Service>> #3C8A3C
    BackgroundColor<<interface>> #F4FBF4
    BorderColor<<interface>> #3C8A3C
    BackgroundColor<<Repository>> #FFF4E0
    BorderColor<<Repository>> #B07A1F
    BackgroundColor<<entity>> #FFF4E0
    BorderColor<<entity>> #B07A1F
}
hide empty members

class RecommendationController <<RestController>> {
    + getForItemList(id : Long) : ResponseEntity<List<ItemDTO>>
    + getForUser(id : Long) : ResponseEntity<List<ItemDTO>>
    + getSongsForUser(id : Long, limit : Integer) : ResponseEntity<List<SongDTO>>
    + getLessonsForUser(id : Long) : ResponseEntity<List<LessonDTO>>
    + getForGenre(id : Long) : ResponseEntity<List<LessonDTO>>
    + getFavouriteInstrumentGenreCombinationIds(id : Long) : ResponseEntity<List<Long>>
    + getMostUsedGenreInItemListsIds(id : Long) : ResponseEntity<List<Long>>
}
note right of RecommendationController : @RequestMapping("/api/recommendations")\n.../by-item-list/{id}: @ownership.ownsItemList\n.../by-user/{id}: @ownership.isSelf

package "service.recommendation" {
    interface ItemRecommendationService <<interface>> {
        + findForItemList(id : Long) : List<ItemDTO>
        + findForUser(id : Long) : List<ItemDTO>
    }

    class ItemRecommendationServiceImpl <<Service>> {
        - songRecommendationService : SongRecommendationService
        - genreRecommendationService : GenreRecommendationService
        - instrumentGenreRecommendationService : InstrumentGenreRecommendationService
        - lessonRecommendationService : LessonRecommendationService
        - dtoMapper : DtoMapper
    }
    note right of ItemRecommendationServiceImpl
        Junta los cuatro resultados en un
        LinkedHashSet<Item> (sin duplicados):
        - lista: 10 canciones, 1 género, 3 instrument-genres
          y 6 lecciones; se baraja (Collections.shuffle)
          para mezclar los tipos
        - usuario (Home): 6, 1, 2 y 3, en orden de prioridad
        Después DtoMapper.itemsToItemDTOs (DTO de cada subtipo, con type)
    end note

    interface SongRecommendationService <<interface>> {
        + findForItemList(id : Long, limit : int) : SequencedSet<Song>
        + findForUser(id : Long, limit : int) : SequencedSet<Song>
    }
    interface GenreRecommendationService <<interface>> {
        + findForItemList(id : Long, limit : int) : SequencedSet<Genre>
        + findForUser(id : Long, limit : int) : SequencedSet<Genre>
        + findMostUsedInItemListsForUser(id : Long, limit : int) : SequencedSet<Genre>
    }
    interface InstrumentGenreRecommendationService <<interface>> {
        + findForItemList(id : Long, limit : int) : SequencedSet<InstrumentGenre>
        + findForUser(id : Long, limit : int) : SequencedSet<InstrumentGenre>
        + findFavouriteCombinationsForUser(id : Long, limit : int) : SequencedSet<InstrumentGenre>
    }
    interface LessonRecommendationService <<interface>> {
        + findForItemList(id : Long, limit : int) : SequencedSet<Lesson>
        + findForUser(id : Long, limit : int) : SequencedSet<Lesson>
        + findForGenre(id : Long, limit : int) : List<LessonDTO>
    }

    class SongRecommendationServiceImpl <<Service>> {
        - songRepository : SongRepository
    }
    class GenreRecommendationServiceImpl <<Service>> {
        - genreRepository : GenreRepository
    }
    class InstrumentGenreRecommendationServiceImpl <<Service>> {
        - instrumentGenreRepository : InstrumentGenreRepository
    }
    class LessonRecommendationServiceImpl <<Service>> {
        - lessonRepository : LessonRepository
        - dtoMapper : DtoMapper
    }
}

note bottom of SongRecommendationServiceImpl
    Algoritmo por niveles: cada nivel completa lo
    que falta del anterior y se para al llegar al límite.
    Exclusiones acumuladas como Set<Long> (consultas
    ...IdNotIn con Utils.idsToExclude). Por usuario,
    solo canciones con level <= User.difficultyLevel.
end note

package "model" {
    class ItemList <<entity>> {
        + getOnlyGenre() : Optional<Genre>
        + getMainGenreFromItems() : Optional<Genre>
        + getMainInstrumentFromItems() : Optional<Instrument>
        + getTopGenresFromItems(topN : int) : List<Genre>
        + getTopInstrumentsFromItems(topN : int) : List<Instrument>
        {method} ...
    }
    class User <<entity>> {
        + getTopGenresFromItemLists(topN : int) : List<Genre>
        + getTopInstrumentsFromItemLists(topN : int) : List<Instrument>
        + getIdsExcludedFromRecommendationsOfType(type : Class<T>) : Set<Long>
        {method} ...
    }
}

package "utils" {
    class EntityResolver {
        + {static} resolveItemList(id : Long) : ItemList
        + {static} resolveUser(id : Long) : User
    }
    class Utils {
        + {static} getTopNMostRepeated(items : List<T>, n : int) : List<T>
        + {static} idsToExclude(ids : Collection<Long>) : Collection<Long>
        + {static} resolvePageable(limit : Integer) : Pageable
    }
    class RecommendationConstants {
        + {static} N_RECOMMENDED_SONGS : int = 10
        + {static} N_RECOMMENDED_GENRES : int = 1
        + {static} N_RECOMMENDED_INSTRUMENT_GENRES : int = 3
        + {static} N_RECOMMENDED_LESSONS : int = 6
        + {static} N_HOME_RECOMMENDED_SONGS : int = 6
        + {static} N_HOME_RECOMMENDED_GENRES : int = 1
        + {static} N_HOME_RECOMMENDED_INSTRUMENT_GENRES : int = 2
        + {static} N_HOME_RECOMMENDED_LESSONS : int = 3
        + {static} N_SPOTIFY_RECOMMENDED_SONGS : int = 6
        + {static} N_SPOTIFY_RECOMMENDED_LESSONS : int = 3
        + {static} N_SPOTIFY_RECOMMENDED_INSTRUMENT_GENRES : int = 2
        + {static} N_SPOTIFY_RECOMMENDED_GENRES : int = 1
        {method} ...
    }
    note bottom of RecommendationConstants
        Nomenclatura (N = número de):
        N_[CONTEXTO_]RECOMMENDED_<ITEMS>: cuántos devuelve una recomendación.
        N_<ITEMS>_USED_IN_[CONTEXTO_]<TIPO>_RECOMMENDATION: cuántos usa un algoritmo.
        DEFAULT_N_... / MAX_N_...: valor por defecto y máximo de un parámetro.
        Las N_SPOTIFY_* las usa SpotifyRecommendationServiceImpl (DCD-04).
    end note
}

package "repository" {
    interface SongRepository <<Repository>>
    interface GenreRepository <<Repository>>
    interface InstrumentGenreRepository <<Repository>>
    interface LessonRepository <<Repository>>
}

RecommendationController --> ItemRecommendationService
RecommendationController --> SongRecommendationService
RecommendationController --> GenreRecommendationService
RecommendationController --> InstrumentGenreRecommendationService
RecommendationController --> LessonRecommendationService

ItemRecommendationService <|.. ItemRecommendationServiceImpl
ItemRecommendationServiceImpl --> SongRecommendationService
ItemRecommendationServiceImpl --> GenreRecommendationService
ItemRecommendationServiceImpl --> InstrumentGenreRecommendationService
ItemRecommendationServiceImpl --> LessonRecommendationService

SongRecommendationService <|.. SongRecommendationServiceImpl
GenreRecommendationService <|.. GenreRecommendationServiceImpl
InstrumentGenreRecommendationService <|.. InstrumentGenreRecommendationServiceImpl
LessonRecommendationService <|.. LessonRecommendationServiceImpl

SongRecommendationServiceImpl --> SongRepository
GenreRecommendationServiceImpl --> GenreRepository
InstrumentGenreRecommendationServiceImpl --> InstrumentGenreRepository
LessonRecommendationServiceImpl --> LessonRepository

SongRecommendationServiceImpl ..> EntityResolver : <<use>>
SongRecommendationServiceImpl ..> ItemList : rankings
SongRecommendationServiceImpl ..> User : rankings
SongRecommendationServiceImpl ..> RecommendationConstants : <<use>>
ItemRecommendationServiceImpl ..> RecommendationConstants : <<use>>
ItemList ..> Utils : getTopNMostRepeated
User ..> Utils : getTopNMostRepeated

@enduml
